      "widgets_values": [
        "A continuous shot of the two distinct women in the reference images, each following her corresponding RGB driving dancer. The long blue-haired woman wears a simple navy blue V-neck long-sleeved pullover over a white collared shirt, a solid navy necktie tucked inside the pullover, a navy pleated skirt, plain white ankle socks and white low-top shoes. The blonde woman wears a simple black V-neck long-sleeved pullover with thin dark green neckline trim over a white collared shirt, a solid dark green necktie tucked inside, a black pleated skirt, continuous black pantyhose covering both legs including thighs and knees, and plain black ankle boots. Keep these exact simple uniform silhouettes and consistent skirt hems through the whole shot. Both pullovers are full-length and always cover the waist; no exposed midriff. Preserve each woman's reference face and hair separately. Follow the original hand and limb positions, head orientation, turns, crouches, kicks, timing, camera and framing. Preserve scene lighting, background, contact shadows and natural motion blur."
